       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 151-115
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="13122042"
    >
Liability.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-13122042" data-guid="13122042"></div>
        <div id="questions-13122042" data-guid="13122042" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="13122042_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">This article shall not be construed to relieve or lessen the responsibility or liability of any person, firm or corporation owning, operating, controlling or maintaining buildings covered by this article for damages to person or property caused by any defect therein, nor does the City of Albany assume any such liability or responsibility therefor or any liability to any person for whatever reason whatsoever by the adoption of this article or any acts or omissions arising thereunder.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 13122043"
      id="13122043"
      data-guid="13122043"
      data-position="4134"
      data-full-title="§ 151-116: Penalties for offenses."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="13122043_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="13122043_label" for="13122043_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#13122043"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 151-116
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="13122043"
    >
Penalties for offenses.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-13122043" data-guid="13122043"></div>
        <div id="questions-13122043" data-guid="13122043" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="13122043_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">Any inspector or building owner who shall violate any of the provisions of this article, upon conviction thereof, shall be fined in an amount not exceeding $1,500 or be imprisoned for a period not exceeding 15 days, or both such fine and imprisonment.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
