        <div class="notes" id="notes-13122044" data-guid="13122044"></div>
        <div id="questions-13122044" data-guid="13122044" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="13122044_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">All buildings subject to the requirements of this article shall be in compliance with said requirements by January 1, 2010.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
      </div>
  </div>

